Fixture run directories for tools/cts/deqp-limits-tally-selftest.sh: tiny
host-deqp-run.sh-shaped runs (commit, all.txt, c_000.qpa) holding exactly the
cases `deqp-limits-tally.py --require-pass limits` selects from
tools/cts/gles3-mustpass.txt. Synthetic, not a dEQP result.

  allpass  every selected case Pass
  onefail  the first selected case Fail
  missing  the last selected case absent from the run
